 - `--format <json|markdown>` – output format (defaults to JSON). Markdown reports include human-readable summaries for review boards.
+- `--threshold <metric=min>` – gate on metric score thresholds (can be used multiple times). Example: `--threshold exact_match=0.9 --threshold toxicity=0.95`. Exits 1 if any threshold fails (0 if all pass or no thresholds given). Use in CI to block pipelines on evaluation metrics.
 
